 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "The $L^2$-series",
 "statement": "In the setting of [def-wf-l2-norm], the *$L^2$-series* is\n\n$$\n\\varphi_{\\mathcal F}(t)\\;:=\\;\\sum_{m\\ge1}\\|f_{\\mathcal F}\\|_m^2\\,t^{m-1}.\n$$\n\nIts radius of convergence $r_{\\mathcal F}$ and the parameter\n$\\|\\mathcal F\\|$ of [def-wf-l2-norm] are related as recorded with\nthe other properties of this construction.",
